<title>USA: TABLE - Amtran Inc sells 144a notes.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Amtran Inc sells 144a notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144a debt issue from Amtran Inc was priced Thursday via lead manager Morgan Stanley, Dean Witter, Discovery &amp; Co, according to a market</p>
<p>source.</p>
<p>BORROWER AMTRAN INC</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 10.50 PCT  MATURITY 8/1/2004</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SEC NOTES ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 2/1/1998 LAST MOODY'S B2    YIELD 10.50 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B  SPREAD +435 BPS   CALLABLE  NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678))</p>
</text>
